      "trust": {
        "level": "first-party-local-privileged",
        "executesArbitraryCode": false,
        "notes": [
          "The native Workbench backend calls only the reviewed read tools required by a workflow; the browser receives linked product data, never ERP credentials.",
          "Mutation tools remain available to authorized agents but are never invoked by opening the Workbench.",
          "ERPNext API credentials are supplied at runtime and never stored in this manifest."
        ]
